{"id":"d2537c53f3e071c1","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-term-model-compat.md","title":"term-model — Compatibility alias","display":"term-model — Compatibility alias","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-term-model-compat","aliases":["16-df-term-model-compat","16-term-model"],"display":"term-model — Compatibility alias","depends_on":["[[16-df-term-model]]"],"review_status":"verified-explicit-strong-fragment","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J02","review_date":"2026-10-16","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-term-model-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-term-model-compat</span><span>16-term-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"term-model — Compatibility alias"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7d6e82f8b4b6d41d\" href=\"?note=7d6e82f8b4b6d41d\" title=\"16-df-term-model\">16-df-term-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"verified-explicit-strong-fragment"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J02"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d6e82f8b4b6d41d\" href=\"?note=7d6e82f8b4b6d41d\" title=\"16-df-term-model\">16-df-term-model</a> 所使用的有限强一阶展示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\\)</span> 为该文件完整定义的项模型。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\">\\(\\mathcal T_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\)</span> 为本文件引入的兼容记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_\\Sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_\\Sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>规范模型同时对语境、替换、类型和项作一致商，并显式规定跨代表运输、类型/项重索引和语境理解结构。严格初始性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" href=\"?note=ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" title=\"16-thm-term-model-initial\">16-thm-term-model-initial</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-term-model","status":"resolved","id":"7d6e82f8b4b6d41d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-term-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-term-model","status":"resolved","id":"7d6e82f8b4b6d41d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)$ 取 [[16-df-term-model]] 所使用的有限强一阶展示；$\\mathcal T_\\Sigma$ 为该文件完整定义的项模型。$\\mathcal T_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 为本文件引入的兼容记号。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-term-model-initial","status":"resolved","id":"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"规范模型同时对语境、替换、类型和项作一致商，并显式规定跨代表运输、类型/项重索引和语境理解结构。严格初始性见 [[16-thm-term-model-initial]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_\\Sigma.